  "description": "Yuchan, an impulsive and passionate individual, visits a tattoo shop and meets Jungeol, a reserved but talented tattoo artist known for his strict rules, including not tattooing minors. Despite Jungeol's firm stance and a directive for Yuchan to return in two years, Yuchan persistently engages with him, using charm and determination to challenge the artist's rigid boundaries. Through continuous interactions, occasional direct messages, and a charismatic personality, Yuchan begins to break through Jungeol's stoic demeanor, subtly softening the artist's guarded nature over time.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[Original Novel](https://ridibooks.com/books/945058569)   \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093002527)  \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093002528)",
